Calculate 25% of 400


Results:

1. Calculate 20% of 500
   Similarity: 0.91
   Experience ID: 2

2. Calculate 15% of 200
   Similarity: 0.87
   Experience ID: 1
```

This feature is intended to visually demonstrate semantic search.

