# 21. Streamlit Must Be Read-Only

The Streamlit application must not modify the memory database in Phase 2.

It may:

* SELECT data
* Inspect tables
* Inspect experiences
* Inspect vectors
* Run semantic searches
* Display statistics
* Display retrieval traces

It must NOT:

* Delete experiences
* Modify experiences
* Modify vectors
* Insert experiences
* Modify schema

The agent remains responsible for writing memory.

