# 27. Testing Requirements

Automated tests must be added.

## Test 1 — Database Initialization

Verify that the SQLite database is created successfully.

---

## Test 2 — Experience Storage

Store an experience and verify that it can be retrieved.

---

## Test 3 — Embedding Generation

Verify that `nomic-embed-text` produces an embedding.

The test should verify:

* embedding exists
* embedding is numeric
* dimension is consistent

---

## Test 4 — Vector Storage

Store an embedding in sqlite-vec and verify that it can be retrieved.

---

## Test 5 — Semantic Search

Create multiple experiences.

Search using a semantically related query.

Verify that the expected experience appears among the top results.

Do not require an exact similarity value because embedding/model implementations may vary.

---

## Test 6 — Similarity Threshold

Verify that irrelevant/low-similarity results can be filtered.

---

## Test 7 — Memory Context

Verify that retrieved memories are correctly converted into context for the agent.

---

## Test 8 — Persistent Memory

Store an experience.

Close/reinitialize the application.

Verify that the experience is still available.

---

## Test 9 — Empty Memory

Verify that the agent works correctly when the database contains no previous experiences.

---

## Test 10 — Streamlit Database Access

Verify that Streamlit can open the same SQLite database and display stored experiences.

