# 35. Important Architectural Rule

Do not turn Phase 2 into a self-learning system.

At the end of Phase 2, the agent should only do:

```text
Remember
   ↓
Retrieve
   ↓
Use memory
   ↓
Store new experience
```

It must NOT do:

```text
Evaluate
   ↓
Criticize
   ↓
Learn
   ↓
Change strategy
```

Those capabilities begin in Phase 3.

